[{"title":"九月十日府委撞点巡铺马上得四绝 其四","author":"萧立之","text":"云母灯光夜向阑，乾坤都在梦中间。\n街头月好无人看，十二阑干相对闲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34043,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"北新桥发舟","author":"萧立之","text":"看诗未了不成眠，自揭吟蓬月满川。\n几日秋晴夜来雨，五更半港木犀船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34044,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"垂虹桥三首 其一","author":"萧立之","text":"湖光秋色渺苍寒，一似前时画得看。\n画里人家浑不觉，夕阳留客倚阑干。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34045,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"垂虹桥三首 其二","author":"萧立之","text":"湖天已阔秋更阔，收拾不得难为题。\n欲把平生诗担子，换三间屋住桥西。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34046,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"垂虹桥三首 其三","author":"萧立之","text":"三百里湖桥柱西，谁将并剪上秋机。\n短船不爱闲风月，载得吴松落照归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34047,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"范蠡祠二首 其一","author":"萧立之","text":"响屧廊空王气销，五湖烟雨送归桡。\n鸱夷出自吴宫里，却载沉胥起怒潮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34048,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"范蠡祠二首 其二","author":"萧立之","text":"载得蛾眉共五湖，风流应是阿甄如。\n越王不作曹瞒语，杀贼今年正为渠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34049,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"姑苏台五首 其一","author":"萧立之","text":"金楣玉几翠云裘，那识春风半点愁。\n麋鹿也疑知正色，不应还上此台游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34050,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"姑苏台五首 其二","author":"萧立之","text":"间关薪胆有谁知，正是苏台歌舞时。\n可惜不如陈后主，吴宫无井号胭脂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34051,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"姑苏台五首 其三","author":"萧立之","text":"当年忠死亦堪冤，千古遗编为断魂。\n此恨老天疑未了，长教明月照胥门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34052,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"姑苏台五首 其四","author":"萧立之","text":"娃馆繁华事几年，堕钿遗珥尚依然。\n流香腻粉归何处，都入春风小砑笺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34053,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"姑苏台五首 其五","author":"萧立之","text":"荒荒灌木长烟苔，人道吴王此筑台。\n一望等闲三百里，未应无见越兵来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34054,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出船","author":"萧立之","text":"笔床茶灶且追随，不管征尘涴客衣。\n三百里秋诗卷里，担头挑得大湖归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34055,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"市□□","author":"萧立之","text":"西风无梦此江头，落日阑干小画楼。\n乡信不来秋信早，雁奴闹在荻花洲。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34056,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"画卷四虫 灯蛾","author":"萧立之","text":"是儿欲踞吾火上，自是从来被眼迷。\n只道近前贪炙热，不知流祸及然脐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34057,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"画卷四虫 蝇虎","author":"萧立之","text":"攘臂胥疏自长雄，投机巧中疾如风。\n死诸葛走生仲达，却与淮南策隽功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34058,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"画卷四虫 蛙","author":"萧立之","text":"君王坐底有揖客，未觉当年一部哗。\n可恨人间失蝌蚪，却从月里著虾蟆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34059,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"画卷四虫 蠹鱼","author":"萧立之","text":"生无一点烟火食，死有千年书传香。\n饮墨为何疑罚谪，成仙缘此信荒唐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34060,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太湖石","author":"萧立之","text":"曾共铜驼荆棘里，也看金谷艳阳时。\n汉唐□□□□□，□著兴亡却□□。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34061,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"□□□侄送曾立道韵三首 其一","author":"萧立之","text":"□□□□□帝醉，时节会逢人日阴。\n尘世沧江变平陆，孤臣白发照丹心。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34062,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"□□□侄送曾立道韵三首 其二","author":"萧立之","text":"长蛇猛虎当道路，度密穿青且意行。\n王谢风流不牢落，诸郎还复以诗鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34063,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"□□□侄送曾立道韵三首 其三","author":"萧立之","text":"山中无复物外想，梅花开落又新年。\n人生已分事多少，拟结诗翁向上缘。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34064,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和曾楚山忆苍山韵五首 其一","author":"萧立之","text":"诗来读罢亦伤神，惆怅两翁苍与芸。\n聚首当时惭我少，祗今一老独深云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34065,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和曾楚山忆苍山韵五首 其二","author":"萧立之","text":"芸翁到死不停笔，死去萧然一室居。\n不似王恭无长物，半楼诗板半楼书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34066,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和曾楚山忆苍山韵五首 其三","author":"萧立之","text":"梅边石磴竹边亭，尚记谈谐步晚晴。\n梦断犹疑翁未死，小窗如听读书声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34067,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和曾楚山忆苍山韵五首 其四","author":"萧立之","text":"人谓苍翁只有诗，却于世道早知几。\n□□鞑舞胡□句，辛有伊川后有□。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34068,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和曾楚山忆苍山韵五首 其五","author":"萧立之","text":"两翁教□句中眼，语到□□□□□。\n□□□□□□□，□摇松露写溪藤。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34069,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题黎横舟诗卷二首 其一","author":"萧立之","text":"笔力真能回万牛，不应肯作夜光投。\n都将碧涧红泉好，压倒金精水石秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34070,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题黎横舟诗卷二首 其二","author":"萧立之","text":"老来渐不喜狡狯，输与麻姑却少年。\n掷地丹砂忽璀粲，不知□□有新编。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34071,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"至日","author":"萧立之","text":"急景自忙人自闲，小窗趺坐对南山。\n雪花到地无寻处，都在诗翁两鬓间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34072,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和黄立轩梅诗十首 其一","author":"萧立之","text":"波流茅靡正堪悲，能洁能污墨子丝。\n冬令自玄梅自白，此花还有独醒时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34073,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和黄立轩梅诗十首 其二","author":"萧立之","text":"不肯托根桃李场，千林摇落正孤芳。\n莫将香影生分别，说著香时影亦香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34074,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和黄立轩梅诗十首 其三","author":"萧立之","text":"如梅合是花君子，未论孤高压众芳。\n不以玉堂矜富贵，何曾茅舍怨荒凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34075,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和黄立轩梅诗十首 其四","author":"萧立之","text":"清绝霜枝冠顶开，被人俗了说花魁。\n此花骨相神仙做，市卒能仙为姓梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34076,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和黄立轩梅诗十首 其五","author":"萧立之","text":"读老子章花似道，不嫌雪恶与霜粗。\n能知其白守其黑，长入人间墨画图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34077,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和黄立轩梅诗十首 其六","author":"萧立之","text":"苍天变色雪漫漫，树树江头带恨看。\n旧读史来今记忆，白衣冠客从燕丹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34078,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和黄立轩梅诗十首 其七","author":"萧立之","text":"谁折一枝千里信，江南曾寄与人誇。\n如今不奈城头角，僝僽花神也撒花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34079,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和黄立轩梅诗十首 其八","author":"萧立之","text":"移竹移松半死生，移梅便可主花盟。\n何当绕屋三千树，撰出人间白玉京。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34080,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和黄立轩梅诗十首 其九","author":"萧立之","text":"八表同昏江换陆，孤山今日又花时。\n感时溅泪无人见，只有当年杜老知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34081,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和黄立轩梅诗十首 其十","author":"萧立之","text":"古今有许兴亡恨，出自煌煌入涸阴。\n惆怅雪花如席处，见梅时节又伤心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34082,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢周平洲花粢雪饼之贶","author":"萧立之","text":"染鹦鹉粒作春华，霜粉熬成亦当家。\n崖下老翁今□□，誇张盘饤对梅花。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34083,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠陈子正造墨","author":"萧立之","text":"昔人论墨陈为贵，子姓为陈业更专。\n问子去玄知几世，童乌有艺亦能玄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34084,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪夜作","author":"萧立之","text":"颓云不动天如醉，与夜为谋雪似羞。\n明日诗成春五鼓，一年甲子又从头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34085,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题黎泉山吟卷二首 其一","author":"萧立之","text":"君吟康乐曾吟处，涧碧泉红秋一春。\n安得此泉成雨去，洗空人世撒花尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34086,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题黎泉山吟卷二首 其二","author":"萧立之","text":"杜说在山泉水清，泉山诗好称诗名。\n如今山外正多事，泉出山来应太平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34087,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄杨隐岩二首 其一","author":"萧立之","text":"终日垂帷一卷书，隐岩名字满江湖。\n何时见子华阴道，拍手西风下蹇驴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34088,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄杨隐岩二首 其二","author":"萧立之","text":"老去将诗替却愁，谁将此集落岩幽。\n鸡林增价君能德，夭阏溪藤我自羞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34089,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠画鱼者","author":"萧立之","text":"人言画马落马腹，画鱼须画北溟鲲。\n化作大鹏应不恶，九万里翼摩乾坤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34090,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠丁高士三首 其一","author":"萧立之","text":"洞门锁冷秋风归，江头不作玄裳飞。\n我家凤石调萧史，他家金精期令威。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34091,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠丁高士三首 其二","author":"萧立之","text":"参诗安用走天涯，学诗学仙同一家。\n何处归来有诗法，麻姑掷米作丹砂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34092,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠丁高士三首 其三","author":"萧立之","text":"山中秋老芋栗肥，君归惭我病支离。\n全椒远饷不得酒，弥明相逢惟有诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34093,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题丁虚江诗卷二首 其一","author":"萧立之","text":"江以一虚涵万象，人于方寸著千年。\n勿实所无空所有，亦知诗法似参禅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34094,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题丁虚江诗卷二首 其二","author":"萧立之","text":"华表千年化鹤归，归来言语亦成诗。\n当时城郭人民句，想见如今更可悲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34095,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题曾菊居吟卷","author":"萧立之","text":"苍翁宰柏今几尺，菊居诗来双眼明。\n金精夜半风雨过，竹石草木皆成声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34096,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丁节林吟卷","author":"萧立之","text":"节林三生华表鹤，乞身归来羊角山。\n群仙御风落何处，惟有玉佩留人间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34097,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠熊古月","author":"萧立之","text":"千载虚中无法传，授之握算子能玄。\n老夫后死今为累，更欲蕲生又问年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34098,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠崇仁吴幼清逃儒入老三首 其一","author":"萧立之","text":"向来百尺楼上客，此日崖前藤一枝。\n贺监心期人不识，越中惟有鉴湖知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34099,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠崇仁吴幼清逃儒入老三首 其二","author":"萧立之","text":"风流不落正始后，书传琳琅学古胸。\n收拾乾坤万里眼，归来窗下注参同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34100,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠崇仁吴幼清逃儒入老三首 其三","author":"萧立之","text":"生天不问灵运后，鲁公葛洪皆成仙。\n谁能与我粥饭券，持送酒家还酒钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34101,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠谈阴阳者二首 其一","author":"萧立之","text":"葬书丑唾窭与贱，只为人间觅贵饶。\n试问胡椒八百斛，何如陋巷一箪瓢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34102,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠谈阴阳者二首 其二","author":"萧立之","text":"神工可改命可夺，未有人言郭语诬。\n千载诚翁独遗恨，君能命过日中无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34103,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠庐陵张济夫陈子豪二首 其一","author":"萧立之","text":"凝霜截晓小春寒，争道鞭靴行路难。\n客有儒官敲竹户，老夫犹得汉仪看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34104,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠庐陵张济夫陈子豪二首 其二","author":"萧立之","text":"枉子过从寂寞滨，萧然薄饭荠生孙。\n奇胸宁有杨雄字，重会空留李白樽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34105,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题曹怡轩樵笛吟稿四首 其一","author":"萧立之","text":"曹家诗有黄初脚，江出岷山日夜东。\n机妙斲轮君尔巧，计穷齧镞我何功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34106,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题曹怡轩樵笛吟稿四首 其二","author":"萧立之","text":"梅未能花雪作难，争春春意为谁悭。\n诗翁压倒梅和雪，春在一编樵笛间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34107,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题曹怡轩樵笛吟稿四首 其三","author":"萧立之","text":"吟到古人诗近道，洗空凡马画通神。\n浣花溪上惊人句，剪绿裁红不当春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34108,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题曹怡轩樵笛吟稿四首 其四","author":"萧立之","text":"论诗厌共流俗语，少学衰颓又老来。\n三百篇中有曹国，一千年后欠萧台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34109,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"邀季竹堂过崖下","author":"萧立之","text":"君是寻诗是探梅，柴门几日为君开。\n崖前路近行春好，只为梅花直一来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34110,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题玉庭观二首 其一","author":"萧立之","text":"仙家旧馆玉为庭，白日山前笙鹤鸣。\n我来愿乞丹井水，为洗诗书双眼明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34111,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题玉庭观二首 其二","author":"萧立之","text":"江南绝顶真境界，仙子珊珊鸣佩环。\n千年古井丹不死，夜吐玉虹明屋山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34112,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"收护赠墨者廖景瑞","author":"萧立之","text":"世界人心黑如墨，君持此墨将安适。\n欲磨君墨上笺天，天公愦愦无皂白。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34113,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题梅庄墨","author":"萧立之","text":"子墨玄玄梅白白，以梅号墨岂其情。\n年来黑白无分晓，墨作梅花卖得行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34114,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题梅友吟稿二首 其一","author":"萧立之","text":"三友风流已画图，梅犹君友意何如。\n梅言毋友不如己，定是君诗也似渠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34115,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题梅友吟稿二首 其二","author":"萧立之","text":"出处间关似少陵，流离颠沛得诗成。\n一编窗下秋风夜，中有蜀江涛浪声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34116,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病起行散","author":"萧立之","text":"分得红腰半日晴，苍苔蜡屐竹间亭。\n平畴白水斜阳外，都在黄梅雨里青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34117,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题剑江姚叔宏吟卷三首 其一","author":"萧立之","text":"宝剑能神双玉龙，地灵人亦万夫雄。\n千年紫气不消歇，吐向笔头生白虹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34118,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题剑江姚叔宏吟卷三首 其二","author":"萧立之","text":"一编鼻祖晚唐诗，姚许齐名岱华低。\n天外凤凰须得髓，可嗔儿辈厌家鸡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34119,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]